-include = ["src/**", "tests/**", "docs/**", "README.md", "ROADMAP.md", "LICENSE", "example.json", "rust-toolchain.toml"]
+include = ["examples/**", "src/**", "tests/**", "docs/**", "README.md", "ROADMAP.md", "LICENSE", "example.json", "rust-toolchain.toml"]
 
 [dependencies]
 anstream = "1.0"
diff --git a/docs/api-stability.md b/docs/api-stability.md
index 945fccd..89f316a 100644
--- a/docs/api-stability.md
+++ b/docs/api-stability.md
@@ -4,7 +4,9 @@ The library exports `Formatter<W>`, Read/Write formatting functions,
 configuration/policy types, recovery outcomes and default constants. FLON owns
 rendering, active paths/keys, confirmed storage and styling; it consumes only
 public json-skimmer events. Repository-owned library and CLI code contain no
-unsafe code. This is not a transitive-dependency safety audit.
+unsafe code. The development-only resource example uses a System allocator wrapper with
+unsafe delegation for heap accounting; it is separate from library/CLI code.
+This is not a transitive-dependency safety audit.
 
 ## Contracts to preserve
 
diff --git a/docs/performance.md b/docs/performance.md
index e236fe7..aa2390b 100644
--- a/docs/performance.md
+++ b/docs/performance.md
@@ -250,3 +250,9 @@ remains live timing only. Compare rates with the retained unbuffered results,
 but note the input-size difference; precise before/after claims require running
 the same fixture size and parameters on both implementations. No speedup is
 claimed before developer-run measurements.
